["kuśītaṃ kuṣṭasaṃyuktaṃ śaivaṃ gandhāṣṭakaṃ smṛtam", "candanāgarukarpūra tatmālajala kuṃkumam || kuṣṭaṃ rakta candatam", "jaṭāmāṃsī surabhirtiviṣṇorgandhāṣṭakaṃ smṛtam", "svarūpa candane cora rocanāguru meva ca", "gaṃdhāṣṭakaṃ vinirdiṣṭaṃ gaṇeśasya maheśituḥ", "jaṭāmāṃsī kapiyutā śaktyai gandhāṣṭakaṃ viduḥ", "silūkaḥ kapijodhūmraḥ turuṣkaḥ piṇḍikaviḥ || 7 || silājit ||", "vāmatastu tathā dhūpamagrevāna tu dikṣiṇe", "nivaraṃ dakṣṇekarṇe vāmecaivaṃ tathādyacchat", "māyāmṛtyu mahāpāśādvitirmuktosmi śivosmiti", "śrīkāntiputrāyurvalā rogyaṃ sadā stute"]